        <gr str="3056">saying</gr>, <gr str="2532">and </gr>these <gr str="4012 5130">things </gr>I <gr str="1014">will </gr>that <gr str="4571">thou </gr>affirm <gr str="1226">constantly</gr>, <gr str="2443">that </gr>they who have <gr str="4100">believed </gr>in <gr str="2316">God </gr>may be <gr str="5431">careful </gr>to <gr str="4291">maintain </gr>
        <gr str="2570">good </gr>
        <gr str="2041">works</gr>. These <gr str="5023">things </gr>
